      "content": "idk if a little quiet time is gonna fix it. it's not just about being tired. it's like... i'm just a permanent problem they have to solve every single day. it feels so unfair that they have to spend their whole lives taking care of me instead of just living. i hate that they have to watch me slowly fall apart.",
